{
  "title": "Honeyed Peruvian Lotus Root Skewers",
  "description": "Funky, juicy, kid-friendly Peruvian dish featuring lotus root, honey glaze, and smoky spice.",
  "cuisine": "Peruvian",
  "diet": [
    "lacto-vegetarian",
